### =====================================================================
### END-TO-END (Phase 6): cart and coupons, through the API gateway (port 8080)
###
###   customer -> gateway -> cart-service -> (REST) product-read-service: current price + stock
###
### Needs: infrastructure, auth-service, product-read-service (with stock, Phase 5), cart-service, api-gateway.
### Written for the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run the requests IN ORDER.
### =====================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@vendorToken = {{vendorLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}


### 1. customer2 (user 7, empty cart) logs in
# @name customerLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer2@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 2. vendor2 (Green Basket, store 2) logs in
# @name vendorLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendor2@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 3. vendor2 creates a store coupon: 15 % off (max 40.00) on 150.00 or more
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "GREENWEEK15",
  "description": "Green Basket week: 15% off (up to 40) on 150 or more",
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "discountValue": 15,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 40.00,
  "minOrderAmount": 150.00,
  "validFrom": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2027-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}


### 4. Anyone (no token) can see Green Basket's offers -> GREENWEEK15, GREEN30 and the platform coupons
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/coupons?storeId=2


### 5. The customer adds 3 x Organic Carrot (42.75) and 2 x Haldiram's Aloo Bhujia (55.00) = 238.25
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 12,
  "quantity": 3
}


### 6. ...
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 15,
  "quantity": 2
}


### 7. Pomegranate is out of stock (seed) -> 400 "Pomegranate is out of stock"
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 13,
  "quantity": 1
}


### 8. Tomato is from Fresh Mart -> 409 (one store per cart)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}


### 9. GREENWEEK15: 15 % of 238.25 = 35.74 -> payable 238.25 - 35.74 + 30.00 delivery = 232.51
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/coupon
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "greenweek15"
}


### 10. Checkout page: ready, with today's prices
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 11. A vendor token cannot use the customer cart -> 403
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 12. CLEAN UP: the customer empties the cart
DELETE {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
